  message: "[Wave-0 hygiene re-verify] WI-lodaz is a TRUE_DUPLICATE of WI-jokob-gitut-rifuj-vihag-kazit-pabup-hobav-lovos. Both describe the identical empirical gap: edge.meta.receiver is unpopulated on all edges (0/110533) despite being documented in spec:817/823 and registered in axis_meta_keys.py:131-135. WI-lodaz frames it as a producer gap during call resolution (sibling call_construct and resolution_quality ARE emitted at method_call_recovery.py:196-211 but receiver is not); WI-jokob frames it as a usage-context promotion gap. The fix is singular: populate meta.receiver during call resolution in the call-emit paths (linkers and analyzers). Fixing one automatically fixes the other. Recommend folding WI-lodaz into WI-jokob and closing this item as duplicate."  # b500
